<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/natural-language-processing> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "ERIC scope note: Human communication with computers using natural languages, such as English and Japanese, rather than programming languages, such as BASIC and Pascal. Note: Do not confuse with \"Computational Linguistics.\"" <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/natural-language-processing/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/natural-language-processing> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/Definition> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/natural-language-processing/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/natural-language-processing> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Computational methods for analyzing, interpreting, generating, or otherwise processing human language." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/natural-language-processing/versions/1> .
